  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Help Mauri Mursu on his adventure on the Walrus Islands and cure his hangover!\r\n\r\nMauri Mursu's Hangover is a new 8-bit homebrew game for the NES in 2022! The game gets its inspiration from adventure game classics, such as StarTropics and Zelda, and mixes in a lot of quirky off-beat humor and quests. If you are a fan of those games, you will love this one!"
    }
